   "header": "<h2> Turn options into the future </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Every »venturion« is a commitment to the future and its contribution goes a long way towards the vision of highly efficient production. You will be ready for the highest demands when measuring and setting tools.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/shop/venturion-450-pilot40-en\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy now</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 Expert Meeting</a></p>",
