  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Automated measuring </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">You always receive precise measurement data for your tools, regardless of the operator.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">With CNC control, autofocus and the intuitive »pilot 4.0« device software, »venturion« brings automated tool measurement to your production.</p>",
