  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> »ace« spindle: quick change </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The »ace« spindle accepts any attachment holder directly and without play via its ball bushing. You can insert the appropriate tool holders into the attachment holders and clamp them force-actuated as in the machine tool. The attachment holder is changed in 10 seconds with an accuracy of &lt; 1 µm. The ROD rotation encoder detects the exact position of the C-axis.</p>",
